alues":["The image is a wide hand-drawn charcoal sketch portrait of a young East Asian woman rendered in a rough ink-and-charcoal illustration style, set against a textured off-white paper background with subtle grain and faint tonal variation across its surface. The background is a flat, unbleached cream paper with visible fibre texture, slightly darker at the edges suggesting a scanned or photographed sheet. In the upper-left quadrant, a large handwritten brush-script headline reads \"Still Here\" in thick black strokes, the letters loose and expressive with uneven weight, the word \"Still\" stacked above \"Here\" and a short horizontal dash beneath. Directly below that headline, two lines of small black serif type read \"Same me.\" and \"A quieter day.\" in a lighter, more restrained weight than the brush-script above. The central subject occupies the middle and lower half of the frame: a young woman depicted from the shoulders up, her face turned slightly toward the viewer with a calm, neutral expression. Her hair is rendered in dense, heavy charcoal strokes, long and dark, falling past her shoulders on both sides and parted near the centre of her head, with the texture of individual strokes visible throughout. Her face is left mostly unshaded, the paper white showing through for skin, while her eyes are drawn as small dark ovals with defined brows above them, and her lips are a small dark mark. On the upper-left of her head, a small butterfly-shaped hair clip is suggested with a few delicate lines, echoing the accessory in the source photograph. She wears a scoop-neck top rendered in rough cross-hatched charcoal, the leopard-print pattern suggested through irregular dark spots and patches rather than detailed rendering, the neckline curving low across her chest. A thin gold necklace with a small round pendant hangs at her collarbone, drawn as a fine single line with a tiny circle at its centre. On the right side of the frame, roughly at mid-height, a small black serif label reads \"NO. 01\" with a thin horizontal rule drawn directly beneath it. Below that, in the lower-right area, three short lines of small black serif type read \"Some faces\" \"carry\" \"silent stories.\" stacked vertically with generous leading. The lighting is flat and even across the entire composition, with no cast shadows or highlights, consistent with a hand-drawn illustration on a paper surface where all depth comes from line weight and stroke density rather than light direction. The overall composition is balanced and minimalist, with the dense dark charcoal mass of the figure anchoring the centre while the sparse text elements float in the negative space on either side, creating a quiet, contemplative mood on a restrained palette of black ink on cream paper.","",1024],"widgets_values_named":{"prompt":"The image is a wide hand-drawn charcoal sketch portrait of a young East Asian woman rendered in a rough ink-and-charcoal illustration style, set against a textured off-white paper background with subtle grain and faint tonal variation across its surface. The background is a flat, unbleached cream paper with visible fibre texture, slightly darker at the edges suggesting a scanned or photographed sheet. In the upper-left quadrant, a large handwritten brush-script headline reads \"Still Here\" in thick black strokes, the letters loose and expressive with uneven weight, the word \"Still\" stacked above \"Here\" and a short horizontal dash beneath. Directly below that headline, two lines of small black serif type read \"Same me.\" and \"A quieter day.\" in a lighter, more restrained weight than the brush-script above. The central subject occupies the middle and lower half of the frame: a young woman depicted from the shoulders up, her face turned slightly toward the viewer with a calm, neutral expression. Her hair is rendered in dense, heavy charcoal strokes, long and dark, falling past her shoulders on both sides and parted near the centre of her head, with the texture of individual strokes visible throughout. Her face is left mostly unshaded, the paper white showing through for skin, while her eyes are drawn as small dark ovals with defined brows above them, and her lips are a small dark mark. On the upper-left of her head, a small butterfly-shaped hair clip is suggested with a few delicate lines, echoing the accessory in the source photograph. She wears a scoop-neck top rendered in rough cross-hatched charcoal, the leopard-print pattern suggested through irregular dark spots and patches rather than detailed rendering, the neckline curving low across her chest. A thin gold necklace with a small round pendant hangs at her collarbone, drawn as a fine single line with a tiny circle at its centre. On the right side of the frame, roughly at mid-height, a small black serif label reads \"NO. 01\" with a thin horizontal rule drawn directly beneath it. Below that, in the lower-right area, three short lines of small black serif type read \"Some faces\" \"carry\" \"silent stories.\" stacked vertically with generous leading. The lighting is flat and even across the entire composition, with no cast shadows or highlights, consistent with a hand-drawn illustration on a paper surface where all depth comes from line weight and stroke density rather than light direction. The overall composition is balanced and minimalist, with the dense dark charcoal mass of the figure anchoring the centre while the sparse text elements float in the negative space on either side, creating a quiet, contemplative mood on a restrained palette of black ink on cream paper.","negative_prompt":"","resolution":1024}},{"id":504,"type":"Display Any (rgthree)","pos":[1100,2380],"size":[560,560],"flags":{},"order":11,"mode":4,"inputs":[{"dir":3,"label":"输入","localized_name":"输入","name":"source","type":"*","link":776}],"outputs":[],"title":"显示任意","properties":{"cnr_id":"rgthree-comfy","ver":"1.0.2608272350","Node name for S&R":"Display Any (rgthree)"},"widgets_values":[""],"widgets_values_named":{"output":""}},{"id":505,"type":"Text Multiline","pos":[-650,2320],"size":[660,360],"flags":{},"order":3,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"label":"文本","localized_name":"文本","name":"text","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"text"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"label":"字符串","localized_name":"字符串","name":"STRING","type":"STRING","links":[777]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"Text Multiline"},"widgets_values":["这是一幅横版古装写实角色设定三视图，纯白色背景，画面由四格横排无缝拼接而成，从左到右依次是头部近景特写、正面全身立绘、右侧面全身立绘、背面全身立绘，四格按约三成一、两成三、两成三、两成三的宽度分配，格与格之间没有间隙、没有分隔线、没有边框。第一格是一位二十二岁东方女子的头部近景特写，面部居中、直视镜头、头顶与下巴均不裁切；她是鹅蛋脸，柳叶细眉，卧蚕明显，眼神温和平静，嘴角浅浅上扬，皮肤自然白皙、脸颊有淡淡红晕；黑发挽成半低髻，灰米色棉麻布带从髻后垂落搭在肩后，颊边两缕碎发，耳侧一枚细小素银耳坠。第二格是正面全身立绘，双脚并拢站立，双手交叠轻放腹前；身穿豆绿色交领右衽水洗棉麻长衫，内搭本白色中衣，袖口卷到小臂露出白内衬，腰前系米棕色粗布围裙，下着本白色长裙，脚穿圆头黑布鞋。第三格是右侧面全身立绘，面部朝左，豆绿色长衫侧面轮廓、围裙系带在身后的系结、垂在肩后的灰米色发带清晰可见。第四格是背面全身立绘：豆绿色长衫后背中缝、围裙在腰后系成的蝴蝶结、灰米色发带垂在发髻下方的长度、本白色长裙垂到脚面的褶裥，以及黑布鞋后跟。四格人物面部、发型、服装、比例完全一致。光线为均匀柔和棚拍柔光，从正前方略偏上打来，四格亮度统一，脚下无投影，背景纯白。整体低饱和豆绿与米白为主，气质温润沉静。"],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"这是一幅横版古装写实角色设定三视图，纯白色背景，画面由四格横排无缝拼接而成，从左到右依次是头部近景特写、正面全身立绘、右侧面全身立绘、背面全身立绘，四格按约三成一、两成三、两成三、两成三的宽度分配，格与格之间没有间隙、没有分隔线、没有边框。第一格是一位二十二岁东方女子的头部近景特写，面部居中、直视镜头、头顶与下巴均不裁切；她是鹅蛋脸，柳叶细眉，卧蚕明显，眼神温和平静，嘴角浅浅上扬，皮肤自然白皙、脸颊有淡淡红晕；黑发挽成半低髻，灰米色棉麻布带从髻后垂落搭在肩后，颊边两缕碎发，耳侧一枚细小素银耳坠。第二格是正面全身立绘，双脚并拢站立，双手交叠轻放腹前；身穿豆绿色交领右衽水洗棉麻长衫，内搭本白色中衣，袖口卷到小臂露出白内衬，腰前系米棕色粗布围裙，下着本白色长裙，脚穿圆头黑布鞋。第三格是右侧面全身立绘，面部朝左，豆绿色长衫侧面轮廓、围裙系带在身后的系结、垂在肩后的灰米色发带清晰可见。第四格是背面全身立绘：豆绿色长衫后背中缝、围裙在腰后系成的蝴蝶结、灰米色发带垂在发髻下方的长度、本白色长裙垂到脚面的褶裥，以及黑布鞋后跟。四格人物面部、发型、服装、比例完全一致。光线为均匀柔和棚拍柔光，从正前方略偏上打来，四格亮度统一，脚下无投影，背景纯白。整体低饱和豆绿与米白为主，气质温润沉静。"},"color":"#232","bgcolor":"#353"},{"id":506,"type":"ZML_PresetResolutionV3","pos":[-640,2730],"size":[300,270],"flags":{},"order":4,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"模型预设","name":"模型预设","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"模型预设"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"分辨率预设","name":"分辨率预设","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"分辨率预设"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"自定义宽","name":"自定义宽","shape":7,"type":"INT","widget":{"name":"自定义宽"},"link":null},{"loca